```java
private static long skip(final long n, final InputStream input) throws IOException {
    long remaining = n;
    while (remaining > 0) {
        long temp = input.skip(remaining);
        if (temp <= 0) {
            break;
        }
        remaining -= temp;
    }
    return n - remaining;
}
```

